From 699287ba0e6ec9e865aaf671e93df4682f519d16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:12:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] xnu: S21 Ultra touch and display patches 0146-0148

0146: touch scaled by the physical panel (touch_panel_w/h boot-args) and
clamped to the console view. 0147: iPhone X display letterboxed on a larger
panel; HID geometry from the console. 0148 (sweetfb_scale=1): iPhone X
scaled to the panel width (1440x3118 on the S21 Ultra). S21+ unchanged.
Checked on the reproduced patch series with host tests in
rguisantos/S21-baremetal (verify_xnu_touch_patch.py, 43/43).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BMMeXnUh8SfBzu3GsrA53v
